{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "label": "EventStream", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Systemweiter Bus fuer One-to-Many-Messaging, das nicht in Eltern-Kind- oder Sender-Empfaenger-Form passt; Refs sind der Default, der Bus die Ausnahme."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_subscribe", "label": "EventStream.subscribe", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gibt true bei neuem Abo zurueck, false bei Duplikat, und wirft bei unbrauchbarem Channel (der leere String wird rundheraus abgelehnt - er benennt kein Event und liest sich wie 'alles')."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_unsubscribe", "label": "EventStream.unsubscribe", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein stoppender Actor gibt seine Subscriptions ab; melde trotzdem ab, wenn ein lebender Actor das Interesse verliert - das kann der Bus nicht wissen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_publish", "label": "EventStream.publish", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fire-and-Forget; die Empfaengermenge steht beim Aufruf fest, eine Abmeldung waehrend der Zustellung wirkt erst ab dem naechsten Event."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventkey", "label": "EventKey.of", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gibt einem plain kind-Type die Aufrufform, die eine Klasse geschenkt bekommt, traegt den Event-Type fuer Predicates und schuetzt - anders als der nackte String - vor einem Tippfehler, der still nie matcht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "label": "Kind-Channel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Matcht genau ein kind - Kinds haben keine Basis, es gibt also kein 'jedes billing.*'. Ein Key und sein String sind derselbe Channel; eine Klasse und ein kind sind zwei Channels, ein Actor mit beiden Abos bekommt zwei Zustellungen pro Publish."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "label": "Klassen-Channel (instanceof-Hierarchie)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subklassen-Instanzen erreichen Base-Class-Subscriber, Subscriber waehlen also ihr Level; alles, was das Framework selbst publisht, ist eine Klasse - Kind-Channels sind fuer eigene Anwendungs-Events."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_predicate_filter", "label": "Predicate-Filterung", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Filtern auf der Bus-Seite ist bei hochfrequenten Channels guenstiger als in jedem onReceive. Kein Dedup fuer Predicate-tragende Abos, weil Funktionen keinen Identitaetsvertrag haben; ein werfendes Predicate gilt als kein Match; Predicates laufen zur Publish-Zeit auf dem Stack des Publishers."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_deadletter", "label": "DeadLetter (Event)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Publishen ist alles, was mit ihr passiert - nichts loggt sie, nichts bewahrt sie auf; ohne Abonnent ist sie weg."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_dispatchererror", "label": "DispatcherError (Event)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror", "label": "SchedulerError (Event)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Traegt nur die cause - ein geplanter Task ist ein anonymes Closure und ein System hat genau einen Scheduler; die Nachrichten-Zustellformen publizieren hier nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_cluster_events", "label": "Cluster-Mitgliedschaftsevents (MemberUp, ReachabilityChanged, ...)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jede Klasse einzeln abonnieren - ClusterEvent ist ein Union-Typ, keine abonnierbare Basisklasse. CurrentClusterState fehlt bewusst: es geht ausschliesslich an den Listener, der danach gefragt hat."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_loose_coupling", "label": "Lose Kopplung fuer Querschnitt-Anliegen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gute Passungen: Querschnitt-Beobachtung, systemweite Benachrichtigungen, Entkoppeln von Actor-Verdrahtung in Tests. Kein Ersatz fuer eine Ref bei genau einem Empfaenger und keine Daten-Pipeline fuer hochvolumige In-Band-Daten."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_subscribe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_unsubscribe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_publish", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_subscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventkey", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventkey", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_kind_channel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_predicate_filter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_subscribe", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_publish", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_deadletter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_publish", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_dispatchererror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_publish", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_cluster_events", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_class_channel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_loose_coupling", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_eventstream", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_dispatchererror", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_dispatchers_dispatchererror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_event_stream_schedulererror", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_fundamentals_timers_and_scheduling_schedulererror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/fundamentals/event-stream.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "hyperedges": []}